WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.940
And it was also a historic victory against human trafficking throughout the region.

00:05.080 --> 00:06.540
What we did was a victory.

00:06.760 --> 00:10.960
And we saved so many lives of people that wouldn't make the journey.

00:11.080 --> 00:14.520
That journey was loaded up with death.

